{"synopsis":"Demi membalas dendam ayahnya,&#x20;\n\nJin Kwon mengasingkan diri untuk berlatih selama 10 tahun.&#x20;\n\n\n\nSaat ia turun gunung, hal yang menunggunya adalah sebuah dunia yang bahkan lebih asing daripada musuhnya.&#x20;\n\n\n\nDunia *Murim* telah lenyap, dan dunia telah berubah menjadi era fantasi yang dikendalikan oleh *skill*.&#x20;\n\nJin Kwon kini hanya bermodalkan tinju dan pakaian bela dirinya.&#x20;\n\n\n\nNamun, hanya karena zaman telah berganti, bukan berarti esensi dari kekuatan juga ikut berubah!","alternative_title":"정권으로 세계최강","author":"Nui","artist":"Rebel Corporation, Yoo Seung-won","chapters":[{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"ch_13","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"0061b49e-b197-428b-bed5-8d1b6b567416","number":"12","chapter":"12","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c3a6bc9c-0b04-4d1c-bc90-8170aa0b02a6/chapter_ch_12/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/c